Great! Since you're learning **React + Tailwind CSS**, focus on the **20% of Tailwind classes that you'll use 80% of the time**.

## 1. Width & Height

```html
<div class="w-full"></div>      <!-- width: 100% -->
<div class="h-screen"></div>    <!-- height: 100vh -->
<div class="w-1/2"></div>       <!-- 50% width -->
```

