## 5. Flexbox (Most Important)

```html
flex
justify-center
items-center
flex-col
gap-4
```

Example:

```jsx
<div className="flex justify-center items-center h-screen">
  <h1>Hello</h1>
</div>
```

### Visual Meaning

```text
justify-center  --> Horizontal center
items-center    --> Vertical center
```

